  Lines:
  - Speaker: Naja
    portrait: {fileID: 688305182712969960, guid: 1306e461193fecb4ba9ee2426b28b7c6, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CHe\u2019s\u2026 still standing?!\u201D"
  - Speaker: Naja
    portrait: {fileID: 688305182712969960, guid: 1306e461193fecb4ba9ee2426b28b7c6, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CAs if nothing happened?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Junandar
    portrait: {fileID: -4330617105125101780, guid: a755e02a59c4f4a4e9262d8ff79cabb4, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CDid you really think that that was all I had?\u201D"
  - Speaker: Junandar
    portrait: {fileID: -4330617105125101780, guid: a755e02a59c4f4a4e9262d8ff79cabb4, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CI\u2019ve mapped and considered every possibility.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Junandar
    portrait: {fileID: -4330617105125101780, guid: a755e02a59c4f4a4e9262d8ff79cabb4, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CThis is a long time coming.\u201D"
  - Speaker: Wiguna
    portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b6a0b8b1f8ccbf24391dc0bad40ecf0c, type: 3}
    Text: "\u201CWe can\u2019t just give up!\u201D"
